00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:23.823
that this founder

00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:24.891
community is very small.

00:05:24.891 --> 00:05:26.225
She said early last week,

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:28.061
text messages were starting to go around.

00:05:28.061 --> 00:05:29.128
It became chatter.

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:30.697
